}

::CW_U03_L04_Q17::[MLA.CW.WR.01] What does "development" mean in this lesson?{
=A. The way an idea grows through story details and choices.#Correct. Development is how the idea is built.
~B. The number of pages only.#Incorrect. Length is not development. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
~C. A random list of objects.#Incorrect. Random lists do not develop ideas. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
