}

::CW_U03_L04_Q18::[MLA.CW.WR.01] Central idea: Forgiveness can begin before trust is fully rebuilt. Which detail supports it?{
~A. The character forgets the conflict entirely.#Incorrect. That removes the complexity. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
~B. The character refuses any repair forever.#Incorrect. That does not show forgiveness beginning. This choice is not supported by the provided context or lesson skill; choose the option grounded in the prompt.
